@startuml scenario2-facade-catalog-sync-notification-sequence
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor AdminUI

box "Channel Partner" #LightBlue
participant "System Of Engagement\nUI-Catalog" as SOE
participant "TMFC001\n---\nCommercial||Provider Catalog" as CPCat
participant "Agreement\nManagement\nTMFC039" as CPAgr
end box

box "CSP France" #LightYellow
participant "Agreement\nManagement\nTMFC039" as FRAgr
participant "Opengateway-Facade" as FRFacade
participant "Catalog\nTMFC001" as FRCat
end box

box "CSP Belgium" #Lavender
participant "Agreement\nManagement\nTMFC039" as BEAgr
participant "Opengateway-Facade" as BEFacade
participant "Catalog\nTMFC001" as BECat
end box

== Contract signed ==
note over CPAgr, BEAgr : same sequence diagram as in scenario 1

group This part of the diagram is hypothetical and could also be done manually using an admin UI catalog to be developed in a later version
end

== New Offer Catalog Notification ==

note left of CPCat
  Once a new product offering is created inside the CSP Catalogs,
  the OpenGateway-Façade translates the internal TMF620 event
  into a standardized TMF936 event, and notifies the subscribed Channel Partner.
end note

note over FRCat : CSP France publishes internally\na TMF620 ProductOfferingCreateEvent\nfor "Location Verification"\n(category = Camara).
FRCat -> FRFacade : 1: TMF620 Event: ProductOfferingCreateEvent\n(productOfferingId=poFR-LocVerif-001,\nname="Location Verification", category="Camara")
FRFacade -> FRFacade : 2: Mapping (TMF620 -> TMF936)
FRFacade -> CPCat : 3: TMF936 Event: ProductOfferingCreateEvent\n(productOfferingId=poFR-LocVerif-001,\nname="Location Verification", category="Camara")
CPCat --> FRFacade : 4: 200 OK
FRFacade --> FRCat : 5: 200 OK

note over BECat : CSP Belgium publishes internally\na TMF620 ProductOfferingCreateEvent\nfor "Location Verification"\n(category = Camara).
BECat -> BEFacade : 6: TMF620 Event: ProductOfferingCreateEvent\n(productOfferingId=poBE-LocVerif-001,\nname="Location Verification", category="Camara")
BEFacade -> BEFacade : 7: Mapping (TMF620 -> TMF936)
BEFacade -> CPCat : 8: TMF936 Event: ProductOfferingCreateEvent\n(productOfferingId=poBE-LocVerif-001,\nname="Location Verification", category="Camara")
CPCat --> BEFacade : 9: 200 OK
BEFacade --> BECat : 10: 200 OK

== CSP Offer Retrieval ==

note left of CPCat
  The Channel Partner queries for offer details using the IDs received
  in the ProductOfferingCreateEvent notifications.
end note

CPCat -> FRFacade : 11: TMF936: GET /productOffering/poFR-LocVerif-001
FRFacade -> FRFacade : 12: Mapping (TMF936 -> TMF620)
FRFacade -> FRCat : 13: TMF620: GET /productOffering/poFR-LocVerif-001
FRCat --> FRFacade : 14: ProductOffering_FR (Location Verification)
FRFacade -> FRFacade : 15: Mapping (TMF620 -> TMF936)
FRFacade --> CPCat : 16: ProductOffering_FR (Location Verification)
CPCat -> FRFacade : 17: TMF936: GET /productSpecification/poFR-LocVerif-001
FRFacade -> FRFacade : 18: Mapping (TMF936 -> TMF620)
FRFacade -> FRCat : 19: TMF620: GET /productSpecification/poFR-LocVerif-001
FRCat --> FRFacade : 20: ProductSpec_FR (Location Verification)
FRFacade -> FRFacade : 21: Mapping (TMF620 -> TMF936)
FRFacade --> CPCat : 22: ProductSpec_FR (Location Verification)
CPCat -> CPCat : 23: Create poFR-LocVerif-001

CPCat -> BEFacade : 24: TMF936: GET /productOffering/poBE-LocVerif-001
BEFacade -> BEFacade : 25: Mapping (TMF936 -> TMF620)
BEFacade -> BECat : 26: TMF620: GET /productOffering/poBE-LocVerif-001
BECat --> BEFacade : 27: ProductOffering_BE (Location Verification)
BEFacade -> BEFacade : 28: Mapping (TMF620 -> TMF936)
BEFacade --> CPCat : 29: ProductOffering_BE (Location Verification)
CPCat -> BEFacade : 30: TMF936: GET /productSpecification/poBE-LocVerif-001
BEFacade -> BEFacade : 31: Mapping (TMF936 -> TMF620)
BEFacade -> BECat : 32: TMF620: GET /productSpecification/poBE-LocVerif-001
BECat --> BEFacade : 33: ProductSpec_BE (Location Verification)
BEFacade -> BEFacade : 34: Mapping (TMF620 -> TMF936)
BEFacade --> CPCat : 35: ProductSpec_BE (Location Verification)
CPCat -> CPCat : 36: Create poBE-LocVerif-001

CPCat -> SOE : 37: Push a notification to the UI inbox\nto inform that a new camera offer has been created.

== Manual Creation of a Packaged Offer ==

AdminUI -> SOE : 38: Creation Bundle Offer (via UI)

@enduml
